WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:17.968
Danny: Magic clay! Bello you’ve saved us!

2
00:00:17.969 --> 00:00:21.101
Tina: Calm down, calm down!

3
00:00:21.102 --> 00:00:24.299
Brad: Do you think Hopian gave Bello the clay?

4
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.182
Danny: Maybe.

5
00:00:26.183 --> 00:00:29.023
Danny: Bello, can I use your clay?

6
00:00:29.024 --> 00:00:30.618
Bello: Yes.

7
00:00:30.619 --> 00:00:34.698
Danny: Thanks, Bello. You’ve been a big help.

8
00:00:34.699 --> 00:00:45.743
Danny: Okay, everybody. Are we ready?

9
00:00:45.744 --> 00:00:47.384
Tina: It worked!

10
00:00:47.385 --> 00:00:49.039
Brad: Let’s go!

11
00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:58.044
Danny: Back to Ginormous!

12
00:00:58.045 --> 00:01:06.820
Mr. Smith: Danny? Hmm. I thought I heard him in here.

13
00:01:06.821 --> 00:01:10.301
Brad: How did we land so close to Hopian’s house?

14
00:01:10.302 --> 00:01:12.355
Danny: It’s what I wished for.

15
00:01:12.356 --> 00:01:15.814
Danny: I thought about Hopian’s house when I made the key.

16
00:01:15.815 --> 00:01:19.834
Tina: That’s using your imagination!

17
00:01:19.835 --> 00:01:27.094
Brad: This time, Hopian will be easier to find.

18
00:01:27.095 --> 00:01:29.479
Danny: Hopian, we’re here!

19
00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:31.026
Tina: Hello!

20
00:01:31.027 --> 00:01:32.932
Brad: Hi, Hopian!

21
00:01:32.933 --> 00:01:35.090
Bello: Dada!

22
00:01:35.091 --> 00:01:36.924
Danny: Hopian!

23
00:01:36.925 --> 00:01:38.436
Tina: Where is he?

24
00:01:38.437 --> 00:01:42.326
Brad: Hopian, it’s us!

25
00:01:42.327 --> 00:01:47.120
Bello: Dada? Dada?

26
00:01:47.121 --> 00:01:50.186
Danny: I don’t know where he is, Bello.

27
00:01:50.187 --> 00:01:52.241
Tina: It’s okay, Bello.

28
00:01:52.242 --> 00:01:54.686
Brad: Maybe he went looking for us.

29
00:01:54.687 --> 00:01:56.601
Danny: I’m sure that’s it.

30
00:01:56.602 --> 00:02:03.014
I’m sure he’ll be back here any moment.

31
00:02:03.015 --> 00:02:04.580
Danny: Wait a second!

32
00:02:04.581 --> 00:02:06.664
I don’t remember that!

33
00:02:06.665 --> 00:02:10.101
Tina: Maybe Bello drew it.

34
00:02:10.102 --> 00:02:13.455
Danny: I don’t think so.

35
00:02:13.456 --> 00:02:16.288
Bello, did you do this?

36
00:02:16.289 --> 00:02:17.569
Bello: No.

37
00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:19.910
Brad: So what is it?

38
00:02:19.911 --> 00:02:22.877
Danny: I think it’s a clue from Hopian.

39
00:02:22.878 --> 00:02:24.726
Tina: What does it mean?

40
00:02:24.727 --> 00:02:26.856
Brad: It’s a spider’s web.

41
00:02:26.857 --> 00:02:29.086
Tina: Did he see a spider?

42
00:02:29.087 --> 00:02:31.566
Danny: And that’s a tear . . .

43
00:02:31.567 --> 00:02:34.819
Tina: What happens in a spider’s web?

44
00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:39.099
Brad: Well, if you’re a fly, you get caught.

45
00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:41.467
Danny: Oh no! That’s it!

46
00:02:41.468 --> 00:02:43.932
Tina: Hopian’s been caught?

47
00:02:43.933 --> 00:02:46.490
Danny: Yes, by Tristay.

48
00:02:46.491 --> 00:02:48.501
Brad: The black tear!

49
00:02:48.502 --> 00:02:52.127
The tear is a clue that it was Tristay.

50
00:02:52.128 --> 00:02:56.176
Tina: This is terrible!
